@startuml flow-user
!include _style.iuml
hide footbox
title Example 1: the user asks, the main agent loads the skill

actor "User" as U
participant "Claude Code\n(main agent)" as C
participant "release-notes\nskill folder" as S
participant "Shell" as SH

note over C : knows only the name and\ndescription of every skill
U -> C : "write release notes since v1.2"\nor /release-notes v1.2
activate C
C -> S : description matches:\nload SKILL.md (Skill tool)
activate S
S -> SH : run !`git log ...` lines
SH --> S : output pasted into the body
S --> C : full instructions, $tag = v1.2
deactivate S
C -> S : read assets/template.md
C -> SH : python scripts/check.py NOTES.md
SH --> C : PASS
C --> U : release notes
deactivate C
note over C : the skill stays in context\nfor the rest of the conversation
@enduml
